# Adorned Crocodile (5/3): "When this creature dies, create a 2/2 black Zombie Druid creature token." and "Renew - {B}, Exile
# this card from your graveyard: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature. Activate only as a sorcery."
# Turn 1: Black Lotus and two Moxen pay for the Crocodile, a Mox Jet is left. Bot2 Bolts the Crocodile on turn 2 and Bot1
# gets a Zombie Druid. On turn 3 the renew is refused with the Memnite spell on the stack (CR 307.1), and with a land as the
# target; once the Memnite resolves it puts a +1/+1 counter on the Druid, and the Crocodile is exiled for it.

